      "content": "\"the quiet release\"... that's a heavy way to put it. it sounds a lot more peaceful than just fighting the exhaustion every single morning. sometimes i think the most logical thing to do isn't to keep struggling against the inevitable, but to just stop fighting it entirely. is it really so wrong to want that peace? to just be done with the noise?",
